Запрос в текущем виде нарушает Cover Agent policy: нельзя делать standalone cover poster, 2 quad canvases или 8 изображений. Для B41 допустим только **один Grsai canvas 2048×1152 с сеткой 2×2**, затем он режется на `cover.png` и `inline-01..03.png`. Официальный логотип добавляется только после нарезки на cover.

Содержимое `cover/scene-draft.json` можно оформить так:

```json
{
  "topic_id": "B41",
  "role": "cover-scene",
  "provider": "grsai",
  "canvas": {
    "width": 2048,
    "height": 1152,
    "layout": "2x2_grid",
    "panels": 4
  },
  "output": [
    "cover/cover.png",
    "cover/inline-01.png",
    "cover/inline-02.png",
    "cover/inline-03.png"
  ],
  "subject": {
    "season": "autumn",
    "location": "Tyumen",
    "interior": "realistic lived-in family kitchen",
    "people": "family gathered around a broken freestanding stove",
    "mood": "tense but humane, practical problem-solving",
    "props": [
      "broken stove with visible malfunction",
      "grocery bags and unpacked groceries",
      "smartphone showing a delivery app",
      "kitchen magnets",
      "autumn outerwear details",
      "ordinary household clutter"
    ]
  },
  "cover_panel": {
    "composition": "family and broken stove as the main focal point, groceries in the foreground, smartphone clearly visible near the stove",
    "physical_text_object": {
      "type": "kitchen magnet or small handwritten notice attached to the refrigerator",
      "text": "[EXACT ARTICLE H1 IN CYRILLIC]",
      "must_be": "legible Cyrillic text on a real physical object, not an overlay"
    },
    "phone": {
      "number": "+7 (993) 574-83-22",
      "placement": "visible on a magnet, lock screen, or delivery-app contact screen",
      "must_be": "legible in the generated scene"
    },
    "logo": {
      "model_drawn": false,
      "reserve_area": "clean top-right padding approximately 8-12 percent of tile width",
      "postprocess": "paste official cropped-img_7143.png after slicing",
      "white_plaque": false
    }
  },
  "inline_panels": [
    {
      "id": "inline-01",
      "scene": "close detail of the broken stove controls and family member inspecting the fault",
      "logo": false,
      "text_overlay": false
    },
    {
      "id": "inline-02",
      "scene": "groceries spread across the kitchen table while the family checks a delivery app on a phone",
      "logo": false,
      "text_overlay": false
    },
    {
      "id": "inline-03",
      "scene": "wider Tyumen autumn kitchen view with family planning the repair or replacement of the stove",
      "logo": false,
      "text_overlay": false
    }
  ],
  "global_constraints": [
    "one Grsai generation only",
    "no standalone cover generation",
    "no second quad canvas",
    "no 8-frame batch",
    "no model-drawn brand lockup",
    "no logo on inline panels",
    "no white or gray logo plaque",
    "natural documentary editorial photography",
    "all four panels must be complete 16:9 compositions inside one 2x2 canvas"
  ]
}
```

Нужно заменить `[EXACT ARTICLE H1 IN CYRILLIC]` фактическим H1 статьи перед запуском генерации.
